vps/cron-alert.py                 /home/agent/.hermes/agent-hooks/cron-alert.py      exact     agent:agent  755   restart-gateway
vps/hermes/SOUL.md                /home/agent/.hermes/SOUL.md                        redacted  agent:agent  644   new-chat
